Regional Market Dynamics
•	Asia-Pacific: Dominates global consumption with 45% market share, driven by traditional culinary preferences and growing food processing sectors in China and India.
•	North America: Shows stable demand with preference shifts toward canola and specialty oils, supported by advanced processing technologies and health awareness.
•	Europe: Maintains mature markets with strict sustainability regulations and strong preference for sunflower and rapeseed oils alongside Mediterranean olive oil consumption.
•	Latin America: Emerging as crucial production hub for soybean and sunflower oils, benefiting from abundant agricultural resources and export opportunities.
•	Middle East & Africa: Present growth opportunities through population expansion and urbanization, though remain price-sensitive markets requiring localized strategies.
